    "title": "Full-Stack <span class=\"highlight\">Developer</span> needed for Real Estate <span class=\"highlight\">Development</span> Operating System",
    "description": "We are building a Real Estate <span class=\"highlight\">Development</span> Operating System that helps <span class=\"highlight\">developers</span>, lenders, investors, and project teams manage the entire property <span class=\"highlight\">development</span> lifecycle from a single platform. The system will bring together project planning, design management, construction tracking, budgeting, financial modeling, sales operations, reporting, document management, approvals, and stakeholder collaboration into one centralized solution.\n\nWe are looking for a Full-Stack <span class=\"highlight\">Developer</span> with strong experience in <span class=\"highlight\">React</span>, Node.<span class=\"highlight\">js</span>, and PostgreSQL to help build, scale, and maintain the platform. You will be responsible for developing frontend features, backend services, APIs, and database architecture while ensuring performance, reliability, and scalability. The ideal candidate has experience building production applications, writing clean and maintainable code, designing efficient database structures, and working closely with product and engineering teams to deliver complex business functionality.\n\nExperience with SaaS products, enterprise software, workflow management systems, financial platforms, or real estate technology is highly valued. Familiarity with modern <span class=\"highlight\">development</span> practices, cloud deployments, third-party integrations, and AI-assisted <span class=\"highlight\">development</span> tools such as Cursor, Claude Code, or Codex is a plus.\n\nTo apply, please share links to applications you have built or contributed to, a brief description of your role in each project, and details of your experience with <span class=\"highlight\">React</span>, Node.<span class=\"highlight\">js</span>, and PostgreSQL.",
