        "description": "We are building a Real Estate Development Operating System that helps developers, lenders, investors, and project teams manage the entire property development lifecycle from a single platform. The system will bring together project planning, design management, construction tracking, budgeting, financial modeling, sales operations, reporting, document management, approvals, and stakeholder collaboration into one centralized solution.\n\nWe are looking for a Full-Stack Developer with strong experience in React, Node.js, and PostgreSQL to help build, scale, and maintain the platform. You will be responsible for developing frontend features, backend services, APIs, and database architecture while ensuring performance, reliability, and scalability. The ideal candidate has experience building production applications, writing clean and maintainable code, designing efficient database structures, and working closely with product and engineering teams to deliver complex business functionality.\n\nExperience with SaaS products, enterprise software, workflow management systems, financial platforms, or real estate technology is highly valued. Familiarity with modern development practices, cloud deployments, third-party integrations, and AI-assisted development tools such as Cursor, Claude Code, or Codex is a plus.\n\nTo apply, please share links to applications you have built or contributed to, a brief description of your role in each project, and details of your experience with React, Node.js, and PostgreSQL.",
